  "contentHtml": "<p><!--StartFragment--></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">이번에 출간한 책 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">소중한 인연</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">’ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">일반 우편으로 보냈습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">오늘 아침</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">(8</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">월 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">24</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">일</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">까지 메일 보내주신 선생님들께 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">8</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">월 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">22</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">일</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">, 23</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">일</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">, 24</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">일</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">(오늘은 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">오후 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">5</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">시경 발송 예정</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">사흘에 걸쳐서요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">학교 주소를 알려주신 분들께는 학교로</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">집 주소를 보내신 샘들께는 집으로 발송했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">행정실에서 우편물 관리를 하는 학교는 편리하겠지만</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">교내에서 우편물의 행방을 추적</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">(?)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">해야 찾는 경우도 있겠지요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">? </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">번거로우시겠지만 등기가 아닌 일반 우편을 이용하였음을 이해하여 주세요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. ^^</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt;\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">메일을 보내주신 모든 선생님들께 답장을 드렸습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">그러므로 답장을 받지 않으셨다면 저에게 메일이 오지 않았다는 뜻입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">혹시 보내셨는데 연락이 없었다면 메일 재발송 부탁드립니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">나주공산중</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">작은평화</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">선생님</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">! </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">선생님 성함을 알려주시면 책 보내드리겠습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">서울</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">권쌤</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">님</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">메일 보내셨다면 우송하였을 거예요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">여창숙</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">대구</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">선생님의 메일은 아직 받지 못하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">메일은 보내셨는데 성함을 알려주시지 않은 샘이 계십니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">평해중학교 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">Dream Catcher </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">선생님</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">학교 홈페이지가 열리지 않아 선생님을 찾지 못하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">메일 수신확인도 안 되었어요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">연락</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">부탁드립니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">제가 일반우편으로 보내어 배달사고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">(?)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">가 났다면 조금도 부담 갖지 마시고 다시 연락 주십시오</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. 2</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">차는 확실하게 등기로 보내드리겠습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. ^^</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">샘들이 계신 학교 이름 무지 다양하고 흥미로웠습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">포돌이로에 있는 학교는 경찰들이 안전하게 보호해 주겠죠</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">? </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">우리 자녀들이 명문학교에 진학하면 얼마나 좋을까요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">? </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">실제로 그런 학교가 있었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">명문고등학교</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">). </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">왠지 거룩한 분위기일 것 같은 시온고등학교</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">혹시 보낸 책이 되돌아오면 어쩌나 살짝 염려되는 반송중학교</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">…</span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">전국의 과학샘들께 두루 연락받고 행복했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">출간할 때 재과만 샘들을 염두고 두고 부수를 정하였는데 훨씬 많은 분들이 희망하셨어요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">다른 곳에 보낼 책을 조절할 수 있으므로 필요하신 분은 언제든지 메일 보내 주세요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">고맙습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
